    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d421">

                <pb facs="0470" n="298" xml:id="pg298"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5338</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chilean Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Aldunate</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ambassador of Chile has the honor to greet his excellency the Secretary of
                    State, and to remit herewith a copy of the answer of the Chilean Government to
                    the note of the Chargé d’Affaires of Brazil in which he states that, in view of
                    the pending entrance into the war of the United States of America with Germany,
                    the Republic of Brazil intends to repeal the decree of neutrality towards the
                    belligerents of Europe.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                                1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received June
                            15.</hi>]</dateline>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d421-a1.xml" xpointer="d421-a1"/>
            </div>
